**Rationale:** The Service Ticket and Order Management API is the best match for a customer order fulfillment process. It directly handles customer orders, service tickets, and status tracking—the core requirements for validating and managing a customer order. While compliance checking and service provider assignment involve multiple systems, this API provides the foundational order management capability needed to initiate the full fulfillment workflow. Compliance validation (hazmat, safety) and service provider assignment can then be coordinated through this system with supporting compliance and ITSM resources.
